🛠️ 3 Practice Projects (Small & Focused)
Once you finish the Vehicle project, try these 3 small ones to lock in the concept.
Practice 1: The Payment System 💳
 * Concept: Payment (Parent).
 * Children: CreditCardPayment (cardNumber), PayPalPayment (email).
 * Strategy to use: SINGLE_TABLE.
 * Goal: Create an API that takes a payment type and saves it. Check the DB to see NULLs in the email column when you save a Card.
Practice 2: The Notification System 🔔
 * Concept: Notification (Parent).
 * Children: EmailNotification (subject, body), SMSNotification (phoneNumber).
 * Strategy to use: TABLE_PER_CLASS.
 * Goal: See how Hibernate creates two completely independent tables (email_notification, sms_notification) with no shared parent table.
Practice 3: The Content Management System (CMS) 📺
 * Concept: Content (Parent - id, title, author).
 * Children: Video (duration, quality), Article (body, wordCount).
 * Strategy to use: JOINED.
 * Goal: Understand that Video table only holds duration and id, while the title lives in the Content table.
